<title>USA: Veritas DGC names Tripodo as CFO.</title>
<headline>Veritas DGC names Tripodo as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Veritas DGC Inc said on Monday that it has named Anthony Tripodo as executive vice president and chief financial officer, effective April 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Veritas said Tripodo replaces Richard McNairy, who is leaving the company to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Tripodo has had a distinguished career with Baker Hughes Incorporated in a variety of financial positions, most recently as Vice President of Finance and Administration at Baker Performance Chemicals Inc, the company said.</p>
